      "description": "To exit, exit the train at Wonderland, then take a Bowdoin-bound train to Revere Beach and use Revere Beach Elevator 884. To board, use Revere Beach Elevator 884 to access the Bowdoin platform. Take a Bowdoin-bound train to Beachmont, then transfer to a Wonderland-bound train.",
      "severity": 3,
